    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200801/2002008010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織にこの仕事を受けてほしくてな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002008010120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……どうして私に？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200801/2002008010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002008010130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "この仕事、私はめぐるが向いていると思います\r\nそれに──",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200801/2002008010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『運動で活躍するのはめぐるであるべき』？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002008010140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………そこまでは……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200801/2002008010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、これは俺の想像なんだけど\r\n似たようなことを考えてるんじゃないかと思ってな",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002008010150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それは……",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200801/2002008010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002008010160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200801/2002008010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "得意不得意、向き不向きの話なら別なんだけど\r\n灯織のそれは、また違う話だから",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織だって十分運動神経いいだろ？\r\nアピールポイントなのに、もったいないと思ってな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織に持ってきた理由、\r\nちゃんと言えばよかった、すまん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002008010170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そんなことありません\r\nその、……ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200801/2002008010170"
  },
  {
